    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index retreated back below the 6,000 point mark, dropping by 752 points week-onweek to 5,998. The W.AustraliaQingdao iron ore spot voyage rate was down by $2.20/t to $8.05/t, while the round-voyage rate more than halved to $9,150/day.",
